"id":"wangwei-q-0e65e14280057f160302","section":"chapter-021","block":"b-2800a6ae2cd76a9cbc92","layer":"original","quote":"卫觊字伯儒，河东安邑人也〖1〗。少夙成〖2〗，以才学称。太祖辟为司空掾、属；除茂陵令、尚书郎〖3〗。","section_title":"王卫二刘傅传第二十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0048.xhtml","index":176,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":50},{"id":"wangwei-q-13d4f55cf2e580e97b2d","section":"chapter-021","block":"b-f6f8ff3221a0b61ced55","layer":"original","quote":"明帝即位，进封閺乡侯，三百户","section_title":"王卫二刘傅传第二十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0048.xhtml","index":207,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":14},{"id":"wangwei-q-2010a73f942c36e19f35","section":"chapter-021","block":"b-e8cab8d4638d3a8479fc","layer":"pei","quote":"太祖使荀彧问觊，觊以为：‘西方诸将，皆竖夫屈起；无雄天下意，苟安乐目前而已。今国家厚加爵号，得其所志，非有大故，不忧为变也，宜为后图。若以兵入关中，当讨张鲁；鲁在深山，道径不通，彼必疑之；一相惊动，地险众强，殆难为虑","attribution":"裴注·魏书","section_title":"王卫二刘傅传第二十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0048.xhtml","index":201,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-e605f11e17829ef130c6","start":88,"end":196},{"id":"wangwei-q-3148be3cf15e29868f33","section":"chapter-021","block":"b-c5a68c8975d950778174","layer":"original","quote":"评曰：昔文帝、陈王以公子之尊〖1〗，博好文采；同声相应，才士并出，惟粲等六人最见名目〖2〗。而粲特处常伯之官〖3〗，兴一代之制；然其冲虚德宇〖4〗，未若徐幹之粹也。卫觊亦以多识典故，相时王之式〖5〗。刘劭该览学籍，文质周洽。刘廙以清鉴著〖6〗，傅嘏用才达显云〖7〗。﹝一﹞","section_title":"王卫二刘傅传第二十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0048.xhtml","index":558,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":136},{"id":"wangwei-q-3bf7fc16ffa74a10b572","section":"chapter-021","block":"b-d3b3ec14b4b990d07331","layer":"original","quote":"顷之，还汉朝为侍郎","section_title":"王卫二刘傅传第二十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0048.xhtml","index":202,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":14,"end":23},{"id":"wangwei-q-415197894694db0d1f32","section":"chapter-021","block":"b-e8cab8d4638d3a8479fc","layer":"pei","quote":"初，汉朝迁移，台阁旧事散乱。自都许之后，渐有纲纪，觊以古义多所正定","attribution":"裴注·魏书","section_title":"王卫二刘傅传第二十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0048.xhtml","index":201,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-e605f11e17829ef130c6","start":10,"end":43},{"id":"wangwei-q-47f3a2f20596c9158d42","section":"chapter-021","block":"b-c3ccd5bb517143010892","layer":"original","quote":"至长安，道路不通，觊不得进，遂留镇关中","section_title":"王卫二刘傅传第二十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0048.xhtml","index":177,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":63,"end":82},{"id":"wangwei-q-4a06db32ac01f68b88af","section":"chapter-021","block":"b-d3b3ec14b4b990d07331","layer":"original","quote":"劝赞禅代之义，为文诰之诏","section_title":"王卫二刘傅传第二十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0048.xhtml","index":202,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":27,"end":39},{"id":"wangwei-q-67c936bba3f0196206c1","section":"chapter-021","block":"b-c3ccd5bb517143010892","layer":"original","quote":"益州牧刘璋与表有隙〖5〗，觊以治书侍御史使益州〖6〗，令璋下兵以缀表军","section_title":"王卫二刘傅传第二十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0048.xhtml","index":177,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":24,"end":59},{"id":"wangwei-q-69f5d7d2838aa260d884","section":"chapter-021","block":"b-f6f8ff3221a0b61ced55","layer":"original","quote":"觊奏曰：“九章之律〖1〗，自古所传；断定刑罪，其意微妙。百里长吏〖2〗，皆宜知律。刑法者，国家之所贵重，而私议之所轻贱；狱吏者，百姓之所悬命〖3〗，而选用者之所卑下〖4〗。王政之弊，未必不由此也。请置律博士〖5〗，转相教授。”事遂施行","section_title":"王卫二刘傅传第二十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0048.xhtml","index":207,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":18,"end":135},{"id":"wangwei-q-720b39da1991111620ec","section":"chapter-021","block":"b-d1b916c41119a5c3af91","layer":"original","quote":"觊书与荀彧曰〖10〗：“关中，膏腴之地；顷遭荒乱，人民流入荆州者十万余家。闻本土安宁，皆企望思归。而归者无以自业〖11〗，诸将各竞招怀，以为部曲。郡县贫弱，不能与争，兵家遂强〖12〗。一旦变动，必有后忧。夫盐，国之大宝也，自乱来散放〖13〗，宜如旧置使者监卖。以其直益市犁牛〖14〗，若有归民，以供给之。勤耕积粟，以丰殖关中。远民闻之，必日夜竞还。又使司隶校尉留治关中以为之主〖15〗，则诸将日削，官民日盛，此强本弱敌之利也。”","section_title":"王卫二刘傅传第二十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0048.xhtml","index":178,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":24,"end":238},{"id":"wangwei-q-78f0f59d100d090aee46","section":"chapter-021","block":"b-3b0329ea059a2ff23ccc","layer":"pei","quote":"敬侯写淳《尚书》，后以示淳，而淳不别","attribution":"裴注·卫恒《四体书势》","section_title":"王卫二刘傅传第二十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0048.xhtml","index":413,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-9886d275cee1012511a7","start":111,"end":129},{"id":"wangwei-q-7bcdf06cc56159cf8cab","section":"chapter-021","block":"b-c87ecd971cad4d9825af","layer":"original","quote":"时百姓凋匮而役务方殷〖6〗，觊上疏曰：“夫变情励性〖7〗，强所不能〖8〗；人臣言之既不易，人主受之又艰难。且人之所乐者，富贵、显荣也；所恶者，贫贱、死亡也。然此四者，君上之所制也。君爱之则富贵、显荣，君恶之则贫贱、死亡。顺指者，爱所由来；逆意者，恶所从至也。故人臣皆争顺指而避逆意；非破家为国杀身成君者〖9〗，谁能犯颜色，触忌讳，建一言，开一说哉？陛下留意察之，则臣下之情可见矣。今议者多好悦耳，其言政治，则比陛下于尧、舜〖10〗，其言征伐，则比二虏于狸鼠〖11〗。臣以为不然。昔汉文之时〖12〗，诸侯强大，贾谊累息以为至危〖13〗。况今四海之内，分而为三，群士陈力〖14〗，各为其主。其来降者，未肯言舍邪就正，咸称迫于困急，是与六国分治无以为异也〖15〗。当今千里无烟〖16〗，遗民困苦；陛下不善留意〖17〗，将遂凋弊不可复振。礼：天子之器必有金玉之饰，饮食之肴必有八珍之味〖18〗；至于凶荒，则彻膳降服〖19〗。然则奢俭之节，必视世之丰约也。武皇帝之时〖20〗，后宫食不过一肉，衣不用锦绣，茵蓐不缘饰，器物无丹漆；用能平定天下，遗福子孙。此皆陛下之所亲览也。当今之务，宜君臣上下，并用筹策；计校府库，量入为出。深思句践滋民之术〖21〗，（由）〔犹〕恐不及；而尚方所造金银之物〖22〗，渐更增广；工役不辍，侈靡日崇，帑藏日竭〖23〗。昔汉武信求神仙之道〖24〗，谓当得云表之露以餐玉屑，故立仙掌以承高露〖25〗。陛下通明〖26〗，每所非笑〖27〗。汉武有求于露，而（由）〔犹〕尚见非；陛下无求于露而空设之〖28〗，不益于好而糜费功夫。诚皆圣虑所宜裁制也。”","section_title":"王卫二刘傅传第二十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0048.xhtml","index":208,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":679},{"id":"wangwei-q-8ea6c1061f8c7d4984e6","section":"chapter-021","block":"b-d3b3ec14b4b990d07331","layer":"original","quote":"文帝即王位，徙为尚书","section_title":"王卫二刘傅传第二十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0048.xhtml","index":202,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":10},{"id":"wangwei-q-aaf367fa3027082deb41","section":"chapter-021","block":"b-2800a6ae2cd76a9cbc92","layer":"original","quote":"除茂陵令、尚书郎","section_title":"王卫二刘傅传第二十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0048.xhtml","index":176,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":38,"end":46},{"id":"wangwei-q-ad225caa18c702e414fe","section":"chapter-021","block":"b-49930498596dfa1b6859","layer":"original","quote":"关中服从，乃白召觊还","section_title":"王卫二刘傅传第二十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0048.xhtml","index":179,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":10},{"id":"wangwei-q-ad34f843c7d9a6db25cb","section":"chapter-021","block":"b-d3b3ec14b4b990d07331","layer":"original","quote":"文帝践阼，复为尚书，封阳吉亭侯","section_title":"王卫二刘傅传第二十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0048.xhtml","index":202,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":43,"end":58},{"id":"wangwei-q-e2756e1dd23f089607f4","section":"chapter-021","block":"b-fa421aa2e199183eb2d0","layer":"original","quote":"觊薨〖33〗，谥曰敬侯","section_title":"王卫二刘傅传第二十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0048.xhtml","index":211,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":11},{"id":"wangwei-q-ede7e2125d4046983fb3","section":"chapter-021","block":"b-49930498596dfa1b6859","layer":"original","quote":"魏国既建，拜侍中，与王粲并典制度","section_title":"王卫二刘傅传第二十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0048.xhtml","index":179,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":27,"end":43},{"id":"wangwei-q-f0dc83ec6e549a0532c6","section":"chapter-021","block":"b-6a4e725d1a5f043a99cb","layer":"original","quote":"受诏典著作","section_title":"王卫二刘傅传第二十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0048.xhtml","index":209,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":15,"end":20},{"id":"wangwei-q-fa4522b5b0ee8d96a25a","section":"chapter-021","block":"b-6a4e725d1a5f043a99cb","layer":"original","quote":"又为《魏官仪》，凡所撰述数十篇","section_title":"王卫二刘傅传第二十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0048.xhtml","index":209,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":25,"end":40},{"id":"wangwei-q-fd16c100fad3200dc5ea","section":"chapter-021","block":"b-49930498596dfa1b6859","layer":"original","quote":"稍迁尚书","section_title":"王卫二刘傅传第二十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0048.xhtml","index":179,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":15,"end":19},{"id":"wudi-e-p115a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-d31f474fc7e57ab9555e","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝二﹞《魏氏春秋》曰：“以荀攸为尚书令；凉茂为仆射；毛玠、崔琰、常林、徐奕、何夔为尚书；王粲、杜袭、卫觊、和洽为侍中。”","attribution":"《魏氏春秋》","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":279,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-efecfa99851d5aa2b4e2","start":0,"end":60},{"id":"wudi-q-b-b9d79988a2b2559f2bb5","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-b9d79988a2b2559f2bb5","layer":"modern","quote":"〖11〗十八年：建安十八年（公元 213）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":137,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-bec99dfe67d67ae54b06","start":0,"end":22},{"id":"wudi-q-o139","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-d44820525c4645832365","layer":"original","quote":"十八年春正月〖11〗，进军濡须口〖12〗；攻破权江西营，获权都督公孙阳〖13〗，乃引军还。诏书并十四州〖14〗，复为九州〖15〗。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":107,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":65},{"id":"wudi-q-p115","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-d31f474fc7e57ab9555e","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝二﹞《魏氏春秋》曰：“以荀攸为尚书令；凉茂为仆射；毛玠、崔琰、常林、徐奕、何夔为尚书；王粲、杜袭、卫觊、和洽为侍中。”","attribution":"《魏氏春秋》","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":279,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-efecfa99851d5aa2b4e2","start":0,"end":60}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
